# Node
node_modules/

# The Android native project (android/) IS tracked — it carries the app's
# portrait/splash/icon config. Its own android/.gitignore excludes build
# artifacts, .gradle/, local.properties and keystores.
#
# The iOS native project (ios/) is generated on macOS with `npx cap add ios`
# (see BUILDING.md). When generated it ships its own ios/.gitignore for Pods/
# and build output, so it can be committed the same way as android/.

# Build output / IDE cruft
.gradle/
*.iml
.DS_Store
.idea/
dist/
